                        "username": "manojpr97"
                    },
                    "message": "This CI failure appears unrelated to this patch.\n\n  The job fails in `openbmc-build-scripts` while building the unit-test Docker\n  image, before `phosphor-host-ipmid` is built or tested. The failure is from\n  `pip3 install --break-system-packages ...` trying to uninstall the Debian\n  `cryptography 46.0.5` package and aborting with `no RECORD file was found`.\n\n  This looks like a CI/container dependency issue, not a patch-specific failure."
                }
